OL,3,A'It took me two years to get a job':
OL,4,AData shows one in eight young people
OL,5,Anot in work or education
OL,6,
OL,7,FJust under one million young people in
OL,8,Fthe UK are not in education, employment
OL,9,For training, according to ONS data
OL,11,FThe latest figures suggest 981,000
OL,12,Fpeople aged 16 to 24 were Neet between
OL,13,FApril and June - an estimated 13% of
OL,14,Fthat age group
OL,16,FThat's down slightly on the first
OL,17,Fquarter of this year - but 3% higher
OL,18,Fthan the same period last year - here's
OL,19,Fmore from our education correspondent
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
